  "details": "When attempting to open your profile, under specific circumstances it'll open your last viewed group instead.\n\nRepro:\n\n1.) Open Profile\n\n2.) Click Represented Group to Open Group Page\n\n3.) Click Profile button; observe nothing changes\n\n4.) Without closing main menu, open another part of the menu\n\n5.) Click profile button again; should open last group\n\nvideo: https://youtu.be/ek-V_IcDETQ\n\nExpected behaviour is it should take you back to your profile, not the last group you viewed.",
